    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the avionics network switch carrier and line card installation, showing the original and thermally redesigned cards as alternates with their matching spacer sets.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the avionics network switch carrier, line card and spacer set, covering the original and the thermally redesigned card standards.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking forward at the switch carrier removed from the rack. The alternates at item 10 are the two line card standards; the spacer set at item 20 is thicker for the redesigned card and the two must be ordered together, which is why the earlier issue of this figure caused ordering errors. The rack assembly at item 30 appears only on aircraft with the second supply rail provision. Sheet 2 shows the card status discrete termination at the rack."
    },
